# Single source of truth for what stays out of the release archive.
# Consumed by .github/workflows/release.yml (rsync --exclude-from) and by
# `wp dist-archive`. Keep new development-only files listed here.
.distignore
.git
.gitignore
.github
GUIDE.md
GUIDE.zh-TW.md
README.zh-TW.md
node_modules
.DS_Store
claude-memory
.claude
*.bak
*.zip
